# shippost — Linux cron schedule (alternative to the macOS LaunchAgent).
# Edit your crontab with:  crontab -e
# Then add ONE line like the below (replace __REPO_DIR__ and the claude bin dir).
#
# Fires daily at 09:13; generate.sh's ~46h guard makes it land every OTHER day.
# Weekly instead: "13 9 * * 0" (Sunday). The guard still applies and every successful
# run resets it (the app's Generate button included), so lower engine.minGapHours in
# config.json (12 is enough) or a Friday app run silently skips the Sunday batch.
# PATH must include the `claude` binary's dir AND jq's dir (usually /usr/bin).

PATH=/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin:__CLAUDE_BIN_DIR__

13 9 * * * /bin/bash __REPO_DIR__/engine/generate.sh
